WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.734 --> 00:00:21.918
Outside, the night was dark, but inside the miller's house logs burned in the fireplace.

2
00:00:21.919 --> 00:00:29.131
Delicious smells filled the kitchen: roast ham, bread, honey, and cookies.

3
00:00:29.132 --> 00:00:34.975
Evergreen branches hung from the rafters, and holly hung on the wall.

4
00:00:34.976 --> 00:00:38.075
It was Christmas Eve.

5
00:00:38.076 --> 00:00:43.608
Some neighbors came in for a glass of wine and a slice of ham.

6
00:00:43.609 --> 00:00:48.125
They shook the miller's hand and laughed with his wife.

7
00:00:48.126 --> 00:00:50.914
Alois was happy too.

8
00:00:50.915 --> 00:00:56.650
She looked forward to seeing Nello tomorrow, on Christmas Day.

9
00:00:56.651 --> 00:01:03.190
Alois put out a big bowl of meat for Patrasche, but he didn't move.

10
00:01:03.191 --> 00:01:07.872
Patrasche's loyalty to Nello was too strong.

11
00:01:07.873 --> 00:01:14.400
He was hungry and cold, but without Nello, he would not eat.

12
00:01:14.401 --> 00:01:19.459
Patrasche had not moved from the door since Nello had left.

13
00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:22.857
He was waiting until he could escape.

14
00:01:22.858 --> 00:01:27.457
"The dog wants Nello," said Master Cogez.

15
00:01:27.458 --> 00:01:33.354
"Good dog! In the morning, I will go over to the hut to see Nello."

16
00:01:33.355 --> 00:01:38.296
But only Patrasche knew that Nello was not in the hut.

17
00:01:38.297 --> 00:01:43.818
Only Patrasche knew that Nello had no food or blankets.

18
00:01:43.819 --> 00:01:51.319
And only Patrasche knew that Nello was somewhere, out there, in the freezing cold.

19
00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:56.453
Another neighbor arrived to join in the Christmas celebrations.

20
00:01:56.454 --> 00:02:03.002
When the neighbor did not close the door properly, Patrasche saw his chance.

21
00:02:03.003 --> 00:02:09.491
He quietly pushed the door open with his nose and ran out into the night.

22
00:02:09.492 --> 00:02:11.548
It was late.

23
00:02:11.549 --> 00:02:17.687
Snow had been falling all evening, and Nello's footprints were gone.

24
00:02:17.688 --> 00:02:22.383
It took Patrasche a long time to find Nello's scent.

25
00:02:22.384 --> 00:02:29.558
He ran back and forth, up and down the road, with his nose lowered to the snow.

26
00:02:29.559 --> 00:02:35.553
When Patrasche found Nello's scent, he quickly followed it down the road.

27
00:02:35.554 --> 00:02:38.609
The weather was wild.

28
00:02:38.610 --> 00:02:46.523
The roads were sheets of ice, everything was dark, and the snow kept falling thick and fast.

29
00:02:46.524 --> 00:02:51.339
In the wind and darkness, Patrasche lost the scent.

30
00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:57.101
He stopped and circled around and around until he found it again.

31
00:02:57.102 --> 00:03:02.809
This happened over and over, but Patrasche wouldn't give up.

32
00:03:02.810 --> 00:03:08.488
Patrasche followed Nello's trail along the familiar road into Antwerp.

33
00:03:08.489 --> 00:03:13.159
It was past midnight when the dog arrived in the city.

34
00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:16.042
The streets were very dark.

35
00:03:16.043 --> 00:03:23.629
Sometimes a narrow ray of light shone through a wooden shutter, but that was all.

36
00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:27.428
There was no sound except for the wind.

37
00:03:27.429 --> 00:03:31.231
Gusts roared down the narrow streets.

38
00:03:31.232 --> 00:03:37.936
The wooden shop signs banged against the walls, and the streetlamps shook.

39
00:03:37.937 --> 00:03:42.560
Many people had walked through the city streets that night.

40
00:03:42.561 --> 00:03:47.911
Friends had visited each other and families had gone to church.

41
00:03:47.912 --> 00:03:55.648
With so many scents to follow, it was difficult for Patrasche to find Nello's trail.

42
00:03:55.649 --> 00:04:01.568
Patrasche followed Nello's scent down twisting alleys and streets.

43
00:04:01.569 --> 00:04:05.994
He poked his nose into dark corners and doorways.

44
00:04:05.995 --> 00:04:08.414
Where was Nello?

45
00:04:08.415 --> 00:04:15.282
Would Patrasche ever find him on this dark, cold Christmas Eve?

46
00:04:15.283 --> 00:04:18.775
Patrasche's fur was wet with snow.

47
00:04:18.776 --> 00:04:21.600
He shivered with cold.

48
00:04:21.601 --> 00:04:28.590
Finally, he followed Nello's scent to a familiar place─the Antwerp cathedral.

49
00:04:28.591 --> 00:04:38.127
"Nello has gone to the things he loves," Patrasche thought.
